  <regions type="content">
    <region left="20" top="64" width="1560" height="32" color="#000000" fontSize="15" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-size: 15px;">L6790A gate drive and start-up check  -  twin of Power Components 76-83, 89-174 and Res. Tank Design 81-87</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="110" width="1560" height="51" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">Every row here is a row of the GUIDE_PQ50_657W workbook (gate_xl.py, 2026-10-22), same formula and same name. Yellow cells are the inputs; the six selected values come FIRST because SMath evaluates top to bottom, and their limits follow as checks. k.* rows</p>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">are margins and read OK at 1 or above. Functions used: sqrt, abs, ln, exp, atan, cos, sin - min/max are the abs() forms of the main sheet.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="185" width="1560" height="27" color="#0f2a44" fontSize="12" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-size: 12px;">1  Design inputs (Device Setting D27 D29, Design Spec D14 D46 D47, Res. Tank Design, Power Components D68)</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="220" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[XL] Maximum input voltage:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
