    </region>
    <region left="20" top="3596" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">this sheet is written for a diode fitted (V.F.off &gt; 0, R.off &gt; 0) - the GOFF-pin branch of the workbook IF is not here.</p>
      </content>
