    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="3729" width="1560" height="27" color="#0f2a44" fontSize="12" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-size: 12px;">6  Selected values (the Selected Value column, Power Components 127-142)</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="3764" width="1560" height="51" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">Entered here, checked in section 7. The workbook recommends: V.drv 15 V, R.on 6.8 ohm (E12 below the log middle of min..max), R.off 2.2, C.gs 0, C.boot 100 nF (E6 above 10 x C.gate), R.boot 0.33 ohm (E12 below half its max). The design uses the main-sheet</p>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">parts of section 14c.1.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="3823" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[PICK] Gate drive voltage V.drv:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="3823" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">V.drv</e>
        <e type="operand">15</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">V</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="3866" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[PICK] Turn-on resistor R.on:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="3866" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.on</e>
        <e type="operand">4.7</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">ohm</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="3909" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[PICK] Turn-off resistor R.off:</p>
