        <p style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-size: 12px;">10  Start-up tank current and OCP margins (Res. Tank Design 83-87)</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="14274" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- Start-up tank peak at f.SU (section 7):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="14274" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="3">
