    <region left="20" top="14624" width="470" height="112" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- Start-up floor before OCP1, the f.SU at which I.su = I.OCP1:</p>
      </content>
